<div id="u-credit-00464-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lqttty" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6736502); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6736502&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605966094" alt="lqttty" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6736502)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lqttty" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6736502); return false;">lqttty</a></span></p>
