<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00185/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一辆与██品牌共享单车无异的共享单车，其异常性质在于车辆标牌无法被电子设备识别，且无涂抹痕迹。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>吉林省██市██路██商场门口<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>就近收容于Site-CN-05低价值物品收容区<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>成像非常清晰，但就是识别不上，气得半死。一一研究员Miku ████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00185" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00185" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00185-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku-maekawa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3522164); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3522164&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605966095" alt="Miku Maekawa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3522164)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku-maekawa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3522164); return false;">Miku Maekawa</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589269677 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 May 2020 07:47</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00362/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一个箱子，在面对猫科动物时似乎拥有无限内存，并持续吸引目击项目的猫科动物跳入其中。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市██宠物店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">保存在SITE-CN-81低价值物品保存柜中。</span>已损坏<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">访问监控录像20██/██/██，██：██：██</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">权限接受</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Dr.Drew:这个箱子肯定没被清理过，那如果我把那根驱逐猫的黄瓜扔进去会怎么样呢？<br />
[数据损坏]</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>附录：</strong>20██/██/██，Dr.Drew将一根00361丢入00362中，在不到一秒间超过█████只不同品种的猫喷涌而出，造成经济损失超过█████元，超过██个异常项目被毁，Dr.Drew侥幸不死，一切损失将由Dr.Drew承担。
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00362" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00362" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00362-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6441401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605966095" alt="zeta-9-beta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6441401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;">zeta-9-beta</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1597578736 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Aug 2020 11:52</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00434/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把四位转轮密码挂锁，当使用者设定密码后，密码将在[数据删除]天后失效，穷举法证明此时该锁不存在正确的密码。商标显示该锁为“OldC锁具&amp;劣质产品®联名款”<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/10/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>研究员ENC的寝室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被研究员ENC以[数据删除]牛顿的力量强行扭开而损坏<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>淦！老子的零食，医药包和[数据删除]都锁在里面呢！——研究员ENC</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;研究员ENC收到的来信，推测为OldC锁具公司发送</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;点击隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>很抱歉给您带来了不好的用户体验</strong><br />
我们的本意是制造一款定期更换密码的门锁，结果他们搞砸了</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00434" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00434" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00434-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6273721&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605966095" alt="EdwardNewtChen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6273721)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;">EdwardNewtChen</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602069146 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 Oct 2020 11:12</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00454/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把高约0.75m的实木椅子，任何<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">人</span>生物坐在其上时均会不可避免的（以头朝下的姿势）摔倒在地。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-█，Dr.4826的办公室。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被永久保存在Site-█，Dr.4826的办公室内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我就不信邪了，██的，我堂堂七尺男儿还坐不上去一把椅子？——Dr.4826<br />
兄弟们，你们要是想我就多来医院看看我，哎呦&#8230;我的脑袋&#8230;——Dr.4826<br />
阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴——Dr.4826</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00454" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00454" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00454-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ngc-4826" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285237); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6285237&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605966095" alt="NGC-4826" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6285237)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ngc-4826" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285237); return false;">NGC-4826</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1604823683 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">08 Nov 2020 08:21</span></p>
</div>
